  "job_B20.20.1_20251003_114511": {
    "chunk_text": "amena gelicnyssa. Iudicium he genemde mesaphaat, & iniquitas mesaphaa, & iustitia sadaca, & clamor suaca. Schesis onomaton, \u00fe\u00e6t ys \u00fe\u00e6t hiw \u00fee manega naman beo\u00f0 gegaderode of myslicum swege & Paromoeon, \u00fe\u00e6t ys on Lyden prope simile, \u00fe\u00e6t ys on Englisc wel gelic. \u00deis ys \u00fe\u00e6t teo\u00f0e hiw. Omoeuteleuton, \u00fe\u00e6t ys on Lyden similis terminatio; omoeu, id est similis, teleuton terminatio; telos \u00de\u00e6t hiw by\u00f0 geciged omoeuteleuton, swa oft swa se middel & se ytemysta d\u00e6l geenda\u00f0 on gelicum Forwel oft \u00fea \u00feeodwitan \u00feus heora meteruers gewur\u00f0ia\u00f0, swa se wynsuma Sedulius iu gefyrn Omoeuptoton, \u00fe\u00e6t by\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hiw \u00fee on gelicum by\u00f0 geendod, swylce ic \u00feus cwe\u00f0e: Cantate, et Polyptoton ys \u00fe\u00e6t feowerteo\u00f0e hiw, & hyt ys \u00feus to undergitanne; nam polon multum dicitur; toton \u00deis hiw ys polyptoton: Guoniam ex ipso, et (17825) per ipsum, et in ipso sunt omnia, ipsi gloria in Hyrmos ys \u00fe\u00e6t fifteo\u00f0e hiw: \u00fe\u00e6t ys ge\u00few\u00e6rlic hiw, swa \u00feis ys: Deus, in nomine tuo saluum me fac: Hyrmos Grece ys gecweden on Lyden conuenientia. Polysindeton ys \u00fe\u00e6t gebed, \u00fee by\u00f0 mid manegum gefegednyssum gefr\u00e6twod, swa ys: Dominus Dialiton \u00feis hiw \u00feola\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s st\u00e6fgefeges, \u00fee boceras cigea\u00f0 coniunctiones",
